## Features
feature-MetricsReportingEnabled = Disable Metrics Reporting
feature-tip-MetricsReportingEnabled = Stops Brave from sending anonymous usage and crash reports.
feature-SafeBrowsingExtendedReportingEnabled = Disable Safe Browsing Reporting
feature-tip-SafeBrowsingExtendedReportingEnabled = Stops Brave from sending extended Safe Browsing data back to servers.
feature-UrlKeyedAnonymizedDataCollectionEnabled = Disable URL Data Collection
feature-tip-UrlKeyedAnonymizedDataCollectionEnabled = Stops sending anonymized URLs to help improve the browser.
feature-FeedbackSurveysEnabled = Disable Feedback Surveys
feature-tip-FeedbackSurveysEnabled = Disables proactive feedback survey prompts.
feature-BraveP3AEnabled = Disable P3A Telemetry
feature-tip-BraveP3AEnabled = Disables Privacy-Preserving Product Analytics completely.
feature-BraveStatsPingEnabled = Disable Daily Stats Ping
feature-tip-BraveStatsPingEnabled = Stops the daily active user ping.
feature-BraveWebDiscoveryEnabled = Disable Web Discovery
feature-tip-BraveWebDiscoveryEnabled = Prevents anonymous search/browsing data from being sent to Brave Search.
feature-AutofillAddressEnabled = Disable Autofill (Addresses)
feature-tip-AutofillAddressEnabled = Disables saving and autofilling addresses.
feature-AutofillCreditCardEnabled = Disable Autofill (Credit Cards)
feature-tip-AutofillCreditCardEnabled = Disables saving and autofilling credit cards.
feature-PasswordManagerEnabled = Disable Password Manager
feature-tip-PasswordManagerEnabled = Disables the built-in password manager.
feature-BrowserSignin = Disable Browser Sign-in
feature-tip-BrowserSignin = Prevents syncing your data to cloud accounts.
feature-WebRtcIPHandling = Disable WebRTC IP Leak
feature-tip-WebRtcIPHandling = Prevents your real IP address from leaking when using a VPN.
feature-QuicAllowed = Disable QUIC Protocol
feature-tip-QuicAllowed = Forces standard TCP, stopping UDP firewall bypasses and tracking.
feature-BlockThirdPartyCookies = Block Third Party Cookies
feature-tip-BlockThirdPartyCookies = Blocks all third-party tracking cookies.
feature-EnableDoNotTrack = Enable Do Not Track
feature-tip-EnableDoNotTrack = Sends a Do Not Track request with your browsing traffic.
feature-GlobalPrivacyControlEnabled = Enable Global Privacy Control
feature-tip-GlobalPrivacyControlEnabled = Enables GPC to tell sites not to sell or share your data.
feature-BraveDeAMPEnabled = Enable De-AMP
feature-tip-BraveDeAMPEnabled = Bypasses Google AMP pages and redirects you to the original website.
feature-BraveDebouncingEnabled = Enable Debouncing
feature-tip-BraveDebouncingEnabled = Skips known tracking redirect hops before you reach your destination.
feature-BraveTrackersStrippingEnabled = Strip URL Trackers
feature-tip-BraveTrackersStrippingEnabled = Automatically removes tracking parameters from URLs.
feature-ReduceAcceptLanguage = Reduce Language Fingerprinting
feature-tip-ReduceAcceptLanguage = Reduces the language data sent to sites to prevent fingerprinting.
feature-ForceGoogleSafeSearch = Force Google SafeSearch
feature-tip-ForceGoogleSafeSearch = Filters explicit search results.
feature-IPFSEnabled = Disable IPFS
feature-tip-IPFSEnabled = Stops peer-to-peer background connections to unknown nodes.
feature-IncognitoModeAvailability = Force Incognito Mode
feature-tip-IncognitoModeAvailability = Forces the browser to always open in Incognito Mode.
feature-PromptForDownloadLocation = Force Download Prompts
feature-tip-PromptForDownloadLocation = Forces Brave to ask where to save a file before downloading, preventing drive-by downloads.
feature-ClearBrowsingDataOnExitList = Clear Data on Exit
feature-tip-ClearBrowsingDataOnExitList = Wipes all cookies, cache, and browsing history the moment the browser closes.
feature-HttpsOnlyMode = Force HTTPS-Only Mode
feature-tip-HttpsOnlyMode = Strictly upgrades all connections to HTTPS and blocks unencrypted HTTP traffic.
feature-BraveRewardsDisabled = Disable Brave Rewards
feature-tip-BraveRewardsDisabled = Completely disables the Brave Crypto Rewards system.
feature-BraveWalletDisabled = Disable Brave Wallet
feature-tip-BraveWalletDisabled = Disables the built-in Brave Crypto Wallet.
feature-BraveVPNDisabled = Disable Brave VPN
feature-tip-BraveVPNDisabled = Removes the Brave VPN integration and prompts.
feature-BraveAIChatEnabled = Disable Brave AI Chat
feature-tip-BraveAIChatEnabled = Disables Brave Leo (AI Chat) integration.
feature-TorDisabled = Disable Tor
feature-tip-TorDisabled = Disables built-in Tor window support.
feature-SyncDisabled = Disable Sync
feature-tip-SyncDisabled = Disables Brave Sync functionality across devices.
feature-BraveNewsDisabled = Disable Brave News
feature-tip-BraveNewsDisabled = Removes the Brave News feed bloat from the New Tab page.
feature-BraveTalkDisabled = Disable Brave Talk
feature-tip-BraveTalkDisabled = Removes the built-in video calling integration.
feature-BraveSpeedreaderEnabled = Disable Speedreader
feature-tip-BraveSpeedreaderEnabled = Completely disables the Speedreader feature, reader mode, and automatic prompts.
feature-BraveWaybackMachineEnabled = Disable Wayback Machine Prompts
feature-tip-BraveWaybackMachineEnabled = Stops Brave from asking to search the Internet Archive when you hit a 404 error.
feature-BackgroundModeEnabled = Disable Background Mode
feature-tip-BackgroundModeEnabled = Prevents extensions/apps from running after the browser is closed.
feature-MediaRecommendationsEnabled = Disable Media Recommendations
feature-tip-MediaRecommendationsEnabled = Disables media recommendations to save memory.
feature-ShoppingListEnabled = Disable Shopping List
feature-tip-ShoppingListEnabled = Disables the shopping list feature.
feature-AlwaysOpenPdfExternally = Always Open PDF Externally
feature-tip-AlwaysOpenPdfExternally = Forces PDFs to download and open in your system viewer instead of the browser.
feature-TranslateEnabled = Disable Translate
feature-tip-TranslateEnabled = Disables automatic translation prompts.
feature-SpellcheckEnabled = Disable Spellcheck
feature-tip-SpellcheckEnabled = Disables the built-in spellchecker to save CPU cycles.
feature-PromotionsEnabled = Disable Promotions
feature-tip-PromotionsEnabled = Disables Brave promotional notifications.
feature-SearchSuggestEnabled = Disable Search Suggestions
feature-tip-SearchSuggestEnabled = Disables predictive search suggestions in the URL bar.
feature-PrintingEnabled = Disable Printing
feature-tip-PrintingEnabled = Disables the browser print function.
feature-DefaultBrowserSettingEnabled = Disable Default Browser Prompt
feature-tip-DefaultBrowserSettingEnabled = Stops Brave from asking to be the default browser.
feature-DeveloperToolsDisabled = Disable Developer Tools
feature-tip-DeveloperToolsDisabled = Disables F12 / Inspect Element.
feature-BravePlaylistEnabled = Disable Brave Playlist
feature-tip-BravePlaylistEnabled = Removes the Brave Playlist media feature.

## Permissions
permission-DefaultGeolocationSetting = Location
permission-tip-DefaultGeolocationSetting = Allows sites to request your physical location.
permission-DefaultVideoCaptureSetting = Camera
permission-tip-DefaultVideoCaptureSetting = Allows sites to record video via your webcam.
permission-DefaultAudioCaptureSetting = Microphone
permission-tip-DefaultAudioCaptureSetting = Allows sites to record audio via your microphone.
permission-DefaultNotificationsSetting = Notifications
permission-tip-DefaultNotificationsSetting = Allows sites to send you native desktop push notifications.
permission-DefaultJavaScriptSetting = JavaScript
permission-tip-DefaultJavaScriptSetting = Allows sites to run interactive scripts. Blocking this breaks almost all websites.
permission-DefaultImagesSetting = Images
permission-tip-DefaultImagesSetting = Allows sites to load and display images.
permission-DefaultPopupsSetting = Pop-ups and Redirects
permission-tip-DefaultPopupsSetting = Allows sites to open new windows or redirect you without your input.
permission-DefaultWebUsbGuardSetting = USB Devices
permission-tip-DefaultWebUsbGuardSetting = Allows sites to request direct connection to your plugged-in USB devices.
permission-DefaultSerialGuardSetting = Serial Ports
permission-tip-DefaultSerialGuardSetting = Allows sites to request connection to hardware via serial ports.
permission-DefaultWebHidGuardSetting = HID Devices
permission-tip-DefaultWebHidGuardSetting = Allows sites to request access to Human Interface Devices (e.g. controllers).
permission-DefaultFileSystemReadGuardSetting = File Editing
permission-tip-DefaultFileSystemReadGuardSetting = Allows sites to read and save files directly to your local file system.
permission-DefaultClipboardSetting = Clipboard
permission-tip-DefaultClipboardSetting = Allows sites to read text and images copied to your clipboard.
permission-DefaultWindowPlacementSetting = Window Management
permission-tip-DefaultWindowPlacementSetting = Allows sites to open windows on specific monitors or in fullscreen.
permission-DefaultLocalFontsSetting = Local Fonts
permission-tip-DefaultLocalFontsSetting = Allows sites to fingerprint your device based on locally installed fonts.
permission-PaymentMethodQueryEnabled = Payment Handlers
permission-tip-PaymentMethodQueryEnabled = Allows sites to check if you have local payment apps installed.
